<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Spivey Hall FY18 Year-End Spend Requests</h1>
  </div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr class="header-table">
        <th style="width: 10%;">Rank</th>
        <th style="width: 45%;">Item Description</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Justification</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Vendor Name</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">State Contract Number if applicable</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Estimate Cost</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Electrical services for installation of Spivey Hall dimmer rack stage lighting system</td>
        <td>Unresolved budget issue. Dimmer rack upgrade was required with FY17 year-end funds, without funds requested for installation. Dimmer rack supports theatrical lighting for Spivey Hall. Production in which students perform to complete degree requirements. Operation of current dimmer rack provides student production assistants training on advanced theatrical lighting and adequately sustain career-based learning and future professional success. Any failure of the current dimmer rack would preclude rehearsals, performances, teaching, learning, and community engagement at Spivey Hall.</td>
        <td>{{ vendor_name_1 }}</td>
        <td>Not on state contract</td>
        <td>{{ estimate_cost_1 }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Spivey Hall Green Room repairing</td>
        <td>After 27 years since first furnished, the Green Room (primary backstage dressing room) is in poor shape and makes impression inconsistent with Hall's brand and reputation for excellence. The Green Room is used by Spivey Hall students and faculty and performing arts faculty and guests, CSU guest speakers, et al.</td>
        <td>{{ vendor_name_2 }}</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>{{ estimate_cost_2 }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3</td>
        <td>Spivey Hall Green Room carpeting</td>
        <td>External funding increased through Chaparral Foundation grant to replace shabby and broken Green Room carpeting. Carpeting is worn thin and unattractive to complete refurbishing and create unified appearance per justification for item 2.</td>
        <td>{{ vendor_name_3 }}</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>{{ estimate_cost_3 }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
    <tfoot>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="5" style="text-align: right;">Total:</td>
        <td>{{ total_estimate_cost }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tfoot>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Purchasing Requisition Form</h2>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p>Submitted by:</p>
        <p><span data-field="submitter_name">{{ submitter_name }}</span></p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p>Date:</p>
        <p><span data-field="date_submitted">{{ date_submitted }}</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Fund Code</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;"><span data-field="fund_code">{{ fund_code }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Department Number</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;"><span data-field="department_number">{{ department_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Program Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="program_number">{{ program_number }}</span></td>
      <td>Class Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="class_number">{{ class_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Project/Grant Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="project_grant_number">{{ project_grant_number }}</span></td>
      <td>Account Number</td>
      <td><span data-field="account_number">{{ account_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Vendor Information</h3>
  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Vendor Name:</td>
      <td><span data-field="vendor_name">{{ vendor_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Vendor Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="vendor_address">{{ vendor_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City / State / ZIP:</td>
      <td><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Vendor Contact:</td>
      <td><span data-field="vendor_contact">{{ vendor_contact }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Vendor Fax:</td>
      <td><span data-field="vendor_fax">{{ vendor_fax }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>SSN:</td>
      <td><span data-field="ssn">{{ ssn }}</span></td>
      <td>FEI:</td>
      <td><span data-field="fei">{{ fei }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Item(s) Requested</h3>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr class="header-table">
        <th style="width: 5%;">Line</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Qty</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Item Description</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Unit Cost</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Total Price</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in line_items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.qty }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ item.unit_cost }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.total_price }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td colspan="4" style="text-align: right;">Total Requisition Cost:</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_requisition_cost">{{ total_requisition_cost }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Attach additional pages if more lines are required</p>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">All Supporting Documents and Competitive Bids Must Be Attached</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p><strong>Business Purpose and Special Instructions Must Be Included Below</strong></p>
    <p><span data-field="business_purpose_instructions">{{ business_purpose_instructions }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p><strong>Requestor Approval(s)</strong></p>
    <table style="width: 50%;">
      <tr>
        <td>Department Approval</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Additional Approval</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>OITS Approval</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Media Approval</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <table style="width: 50%; margin-top: 20px;">
      <tr>
        <td>Purchasing Department Use Only</td>
        <td>PO#<span data-field="po_number">{{ po_number }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

